{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32658","headline":"秋月望上阳宫 · 刘沧","name":"秋月望上阳宫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苔色轻尘锁洞房，乱鸦羣鸽集残阳。\n青山空出禁城日，黄叶自飞宫树霜。\n御路几年香辇去，天津终日水声长。\n此时独立意难尽，正值西风砧杵凉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32658.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32658","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}